                                                "sense_id": "e49f09ab-a330-3556-aaca-cd7fe3f4634e",
                                                "text": "“Earth Two,” a new series by writer James Robinson and artist Nicola Scott, reintroduces the concept by putting a new spin on the original versions of characters like the Green Lantern, the Flash and Superman that diverges notably from the past several decades of DC lore."
