                                                "sense_id": "e49f09ab-a330-3556-aaca-cd7fe3f4634e",
                                                "text": "Allport's decision in 1872 to abolish Second Class on the Midland and effectively upgrade Third Class to the standards of Second, most notably with upholstered seating, sent shockwaves through the Victorian railway."
